<title>USA: SPS Technologies sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>SPS Technologies sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>JENKINTOWN, Pa. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>SPS Technologies Inc said Tuesday its board approved a two-for-one stock split, effective August 20.</p>
<p>The stock of the manufacturer of aerospace and industrial fasteners, precision components and superalloys hit a new 52-week high of 84-5/8 Tuesday afternoon, up 2-5/8.</p>
</text>
